cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Membrane Crystallization
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Mun Seok
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x
abstract: >-
  Online Hebbian crystallization of patterns from a noisy
  observation stream in a complex holographic memory: spectrum
  entropy tracking, extraction fidelity (subspace and per-pattern),
  residue whiteness as the completeness criterion, and
  self-recreation chains measuring the horizon of iterative
  re-derivation. Stdlib-only, including a cyclic Jacobi Hermitian
  eigensolver.
keywords:
  - holographic-memory
  - hebbian-learning
  - crystallization
  - self-recreation
  - wave-computing
